{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/A-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-17-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/B-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-10-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/C-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-09-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>[0] 目前掌管廟務嘅英女士（化名）係周氏後人，她向攝影記者透露，多年前她嘅蜑家漁民祖父出海時，意外撈獲一尊「四姐」木像。祖父將神像帶回家，交給當時年幼嘅英女士當玩具，她仲為神像縫製衣服。豈料英女士其後發起高燒病倒，祖母夢中獲「七姐」托夢，指示祖父將神像安奉廟中供奉。周家遵從神諭，建成而家嘅七姐廟。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/D-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-23-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/E-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-25-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/F-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-11-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>[1] 七姐廟以祈求人緣靈驗聞名，英女士分享咗一則愛情故事。三年前農曆七月初六晚，一名面帶少許「嬰兒肥」嘅略胖男子耐心喺廟前等候至初七子夜參拜，翌年再度前來還願。直到昨日（初六）傍晚，該名男子身穿紅衣，拖住女朋友嘅手前來還願。英女士起初認唔出佢，直至佢拖住女朋友嘅手，帶點靦腆地向英女士微笑，英女士先認出呢位曾經失意嘅信眾，見證一段姻緣開花結果。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/G-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-02-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/H-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-04-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>[2] 談到拜七姐廟嘅心得，英女士認為同神明溝通就好似傾偈咁簡單：「有咩想講就講，將煩惱同七姐講。」如果想知道七姐嘅指示同結果，可以擲筊請示。喺七夕期間，七姐廟除咗係祈求姻緣嘅聖地，亦係信眾傾訴心聲嘅避風港。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/I-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-05-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/J-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-27-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T01:41:09.067868+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":386,"images":11,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}